{"timestamp": 1779378708.1038, "event_type": "tick_start", "tick": 11, "data": {"tick": 11}}
{"timestamp": 1779378714.405664, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779378714.406067, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779378726.3350499, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I just found Charlie dead in Medbay. I had just come down from Cafeteria, and Diana walked in right as I saw the body and reported it, so she's probably clear. However, right before I got there, I saw Alice leaving Medbay and heading towards Upper Engine. Frank was also in Medbay a little earlier. Alice, what exactly happened before you left? Because right now the timing looks really bad for you."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378749.7034009, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob, that\u2019s not right \u2014 I never left Medbay toward Upper Engine. My route was Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay, and I was still in Medbay when the report happened.\n\nWhat I saw: Bob entered Medbay from Cafeteria first, then Charlie came in from Storage. Frank was also in Medbay briefly around then. I saw Bob and Charlie in Medbay for several ticks before the report. Diana walked in right at the end, so I agree she\u2019s probably not the kill.\n\nBut Bob saying he saw me leaving is false from my POV, and the timing was very recent. This looks like it could be a self-report, or Bob is badly mistaken."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378772.085268, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I was in Storage, then went to Medbay, then Electrical. In Medbay around tick 4 I saw Frank there, and later I saw Frank again in Electrical at ticks 7 and 8, so he had moved out of Medbay by then.\n\nI did not see Alice leaving Medbay toward Upper Engine, and I also can\u2019t confirm Bob\u2019s version about me walking in right as he reported \u2014 my route had me going onward to Electrical. So right now Bob and Alice are directly contradicting each other, but Bob\u2019s story also doesn\u2019t match what I saw about my own movement. That makes me a bit suspicious of Bob/self-report, though I\u2019d like to hear Frank and the others before locking in."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378790.111347, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I don\u2019t have direct Medbay info \u2014 my route was Navigation to Storage, and I didn\u2019t see anyone on the way or in Storage.\n\nFrom what\u2019s been said, the biggest issue is Bob\u2019s story has two conflicts: Alice says she never left Medbay toward Upper Engine, and Diana says she wasn\u2019t walking in right as the report happened and was going on toward Electrical. That makes Bob look pretty suspicious to me unless Frank can back up his timing.\n\nI\u2019d like to hear Frank especially: who exactly was in Medbay when you left, and did you see Bob/Alice/Charlie together? Right now I\u2019m leaning Bob for possible self-report, but I want Frank\u2019s info before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378809.542264, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 back to Medbay.\n\nI can confirm Diana\u2019s movement more than Bob\u2019s story: I saw Diana enter Medbay from Storage around tick 3, then later she went from Medbay into Electrical around tick 6, and I saw her in Electrical ticks 6 through 8. So I don\u2019t think Diana was \u201cwalking in right as the report happened\u201d like Bob said.\n\nMost important: when I came back to Medbay at tick 9, I saw Alice, Bob, and Charlie all in Medbay together. Charlie was still there then, and I did **not** see Alice leaving toward Upper Engine. So Bob\u2019s account has two big problems: the Alice movement doesn\u2019t match what I saw, and Diana\u2019s movement doesn\u2019t match either.\n\nGiven that, I\u2019m leaning Bob self-report here. If we\u2019re voting, I think Bob is the best suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378821.3153899, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alice"}}
{"timestamp": 1779378837.596385, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m sticking with Bob here.\n\nMy route was Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay. I got to Medbay and saw Bob enter from Cafeteria at tick 7, then Charlie came in from Storage at tick 8. I saw Bob and Charlie both in Medbay with me at ticks 8, 9, and 10, and Frank was also there at tick 9.\n\nI never left Medbay toward Upper Engine, so Bob saying he saw me leaving is just false. Frank also says he saw me still in Medbay, and Diana/Frank both contradict Bob\u2019s claim about Diana walking in right as the report happened.\n\nSo Bob has falsely placed me leaving the crime scene and falsely described Diana\u2019s timing. With Charlie dying right there and Bob reporting, this really looks like a self-report. I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378854.594959, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was Storage \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical. The only person I clearly tracked was Frank: I saw him in Medbay around tick 4, then later in Electrical at ticks 7 and 8, so he definitely left Medbay before the report.\n\nThe main thing for me is Bob\u2019s story doesn\u2019t match my movement. I was not walking into Medbay right as he reported \u2014 I had already moved on toward Electrical. I also didn\u2019t see Alice leaving toward Upper Engine.\n\nWith Alice and Frank both saying Alice was still in Medbay, and Frank backing up my timing too, Bob\u2019s account has too many false details. I\u2019m leaning strongly Bob self-report here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378868.625076, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I still don\u2019t have direct Medbay info \u2014 I was Navigation \u2192 Storage and saw nobody, so I can\u2019t personally place anyone at the body.\n\nBut after hearing everyone, Bob\u2019s story is the only one that doesn\u2019t line up. Alice says she was still in Medbay, Frank says he saw Alice/Bob/Charlie together at tick 9 and did not see Alice leave, and Diana plus Frank both contradict Bob\u2019s claim that Diana walked in right as the report happened.\n\nThat\u2019s too many false details around the body location. This looks most like a self-report from Bob trying to push Alice. I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779378877.9412339, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Just to restate my info clearly: I went Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 back to Medbay.\n\nI saw Diana move from Medbay into Electrical, and she was with/near me in Electrical on ticks 6, 7, and 8, so Bob saying Diana walked into Medbay right as he reported does not match what I saw.\n\nThen at tick 9 I was back in Medbay and saw Alice, Bob, and Charlie all there together. Charlie was alive at that point, and I did not see Alice leave toward Upper Engine like Bob claimed.\n\nSo from my point of view, Bob\u2019s story has the most contradictions: he falsely places Alice leaving, and his Diana timing is wrong too. I think this is most likely a self-report. I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
